<title>JAPAN: Dai-ichi Katei Denki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai-ichi Katei Denki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 34.85		vs	   34.46</p>
<p> Operating	  119    million    vs	  174    million</p>
<p> Current	    153    million    vs	  176    million</p>
<p> Net		  146    million    vs	  152    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.24 yen	  vs	    2.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     66 million	  vs	  66 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai-ichi Katei Denki Co Ltd is a Tokyo-based electronics retailer.</p>
